<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26834" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δῐῑπετής</span></b>  (better <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Διειπετής</span></b> , cf. Zenodor. ap. Sch.<i><span class="en">
			Od.
			4.477
		</span></i>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίπτω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fallen from
				Zeus,</i> i. e. <i>from heaven,</i>
			
				Ep.
			 epith. of streams, <i>fed</i> or <i>swollen by rain,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				16.174
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.477
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				217
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νάματ᾽ οὐ δ.,</span> of stagnant
			water, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hyps.Fr.</u>
				5(3).31
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ὕδατα,</span> of rain, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Mar.</u>
				21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>divine, bright,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλκός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Emp.
					100.9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰθὴρ διϊπετής</span>”
				<i>divine, holy,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					1267
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. πυρσοῖς</span>
			<i>gleaming</i> with fires, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				43
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>in continual flow,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.24
			</span></i> (expld.as 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαυγής, καθαρός</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Erot.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διϊπετέες οἰωνοί,</span> prob.
				<i>hovering in the sky,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Ven.
				4
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
